{"seq":8,"slug":"energy-science","title":"能源科学与工程","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/energy-science","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"能源科学与工程-简介\">能源科学与工程 简介</h1><p>能源科学与工程是面向国家&quot;双碳&quot;战略的交叉学科，研究太阳能、风能、氢能、生物质能等新能源的开发、转换、存储与利用。该学科融合热物理、电气工程、材料科学与系统控制，培养能够设计高效能源系统的复合型工程人才。</p>\n<p>本课程体系以&quot;源—网—荷—储&quot;一体化新型电力系统为主线，涵盖从基础原理到系统应用的完整知识链条，适合能源与动力工程、新能源科学与工程、电气工程及相关专业高年级本科生与研究生学习。</p>\n<p>第1章<strong>能量转换基础</strong>建立热力学、传热学与半导体物理的理论底座。工程热力学解释能量品质与转换极限，传热学与流体力学提供换热设备设计方法，半导体物理则打开光电转换的微观视角。</p>\n<p>第2章<strong>太阳能与风能</strong>聚焦当前装机增速最快的两大可再生能源。从晶硅光伏到钙钛矿前沿，从陆上风场到远海漂浮式风电，再到聚光太阳能与生物质能的热化学路径，全面覆盖&quot;发电侧&quot;核心技术。</p>\n<p>第3章<strong>储能与氢能</strong>解决可再生能源间歇性问题。涵盖锂电池与固态电池的电化学原理、电解水制氢与燃料电池的氢能全链条，以及抽水蓄能、压缩空气储能等大规模长时储能方案。</p>\n<p>第4章<strong>能源系统集成</strong>将分散的能源技术汇聚为可运行的系统。从并网逆变器与虚拟同步机控制，到微电网能量管理与源荷储协调，最终上升至碳中和政策框架与能源转型经济学。</p>\n<p>推荐学习路径：先掌握第1章热力学与传热基础，再进入第2章了解具体能源转换技术，随后学习第3章储能方案以理解系统灵活性需求，最后通过第4章建立系统级思维。每章的三篇专题文档由浅入深，建议依序阅读。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"energy-conversion-fundamentals","title":"能量转换基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/energy-science/energy-conversion-fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"thermodynamics-energy","title":"工程热力学与能量转换","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/energy-science/energy-conversion-fundamentals/thermodynamics-energy"},{"seq":2,"slug":"heat-transfer-fluid","title":"传热学与流体力学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/energy-science/energy-conversion-fundamentals/heat-transfer-fluid"},{"seq":3,"slug":"semiconductor-photovoltaics","title":"半导体物理与光电转换","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/energy-science/energy-conversion-fundamentals/semiconductor-photovoltaics"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"solar-and-wind-energy","title":"太阳能与风能","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/energy-science/solar-and-wind-energy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"photovoltaic-technology","title":"光伏技术与系统","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/energy-science/solar-and-wind-energy/photovoltaic-technology"},{"seq":2,"slug":"wind-power-engineering","title":"风力发电工程","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/energy-science/solar-and-wind-energy/wind-power-engineering"},{"seq":3,"slug":"solar-thermal-biomass","title":"太阳能热利用与生物质能","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/energy-science/solar-and-wind-energy/solar-thermal-biomass"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"storage-and-hydrogen","title":"储能与氢能","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/energy-science/storage-and-hydrogen","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"battery-storage","title":"电化学储能技术","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/energy-science/storage-and-hydrogen/battery-storage"},{"seq":2,"slug":"hydrogen-fuel-cells","title":"氢能与燃料电池","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/energy-science/storage-and-hydrogen/hydrogen-fuel-cells"},{"seq":3,"slug":"large-scale-storage","title":"大规模储能系统","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/energy-science/storage-and-hydrogen/large-scale-storage"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"energy-systems-integration","title":"能源系统集成","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/energy-science/energy-systems-integration","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"smart-grid-integration","title":"智能电网与新能源并网","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/energy-science/energy-systems-integration/smart-grid-integration"},{"seq":2,"slug":"microgrid-distributed","title":"微电网与分布式能源","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/energy-science/energy-systems-integration/microgrid-distributed"},{"seq":3,"slug":"carbon-neutrality-policy","title":"碳中和与能源政策","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/energy-science/energy-systems-integration/carbon-neutrality-policy"}]}]}